WEBVTT

00:15.667 --> 00:19.015
Oh, so I'm fighting Kaji, then?

00:19.809 --> 00:23.489
Man, what an honor, going at it
with a famous guy like you.

00:23.981 --> 00:26.535
Besides, we're like two of a kind.

00:27.538 --> 00:29.655
What, can't you see it?

00:30.276 --> 00:34.652
I mean, you hit that guy down there
to make him listen to you, right?

00:35.809 --> 00:40.098
I do the same sorta thing,
so I figured we'd get along.

00:41.661 --> 00:44.923
You only need one thing to dominate people.

00:45.692 --> 00:46.824
Fear.

00:47.870 --> 00:51.378
That's why nobody here defies me,

00:52.116 --> 00:53.667
and nobody runs.

00:54.436 --> 00:57.464
Nothing feels better, does it?

00:58.344 --> 01:00.332
Surely you agree.

01:02.092 --> 01:06.203
We're so similar, but one thing
really pisses me off.

01:06.756 --> 01:08.701
Why pretend to be a good guy?

01:09.667 --> 01:13.513
What you guys do is still violence.

01:14.092 --> 01:15.827
"Bofurin"? Seriously?

01:16.436 --> 01:19.452
Protecting the town, its people…

01:19.673 --> 01:21.975
Talk about cringe.

01:22.800 --> 01:24.947
You're more like us, aren't you?

01:25.735 --> 01:26.990
So, hey…

01:28.701 --> 01:31.464
If I win, join KEEL!

01:32.830 --> 01:33.800
Then we can enj-

01:33.800 --> 01:34.535
Shut up.

01:36.740 --> 01:40.178
I listen quietly, and you go
get a big damn head about it…

01:41.489 --> 01:44.098
You think THAT feels good?

01:45.132 --> 01:47.218
A bastard like you…

01:47.772 --> 01:50.326
doesn't get to talk shit about Furin!

03:25.556 --> 03:27.403
Wh-What's with this guy?!

03:28.135 --> 03:31.113
It's like he's a totally different person!

03:32.424 --> 03:36.701
What're you pansies afraid of?!
There's only one of him!

03:36.744 --> 03:38.098
Jump him all at once!

03:38.209 --> 03:39.341
Now!

04:18.110 --> 04:19.778
I don't have time for this.

04:21.653 --> 04:22.510
Who's next?

04:24.578 --> 04:27.261
Where'd all that spirit from before go?

04:27.538 --> 04:29.532
I can appreciate playing it cool,

04:30.012 --> 04:32.092
but why are you holding back?!

04:34.221 --> 04:35.907
Oh, no.

04:36.320 --> 04:38.406
This's a bit of cleansin'.

04:38.683 --> 04:39.593
Huh?

04:39.981 --> 04:44.203
I say savin' friends is my
aesthetic, but look at this.

04:44.830 --> 04:48.633
All that talk, and we still got
our seniors wipin' our asses.

04:49.212 --> 04:51.470
That just means you're weak.

04:52.320 --> 04:53.864
So why in the hell…

04:54.387 --> 04:56.233
are you smiling?!

04:58.990 --> 05:00.720
You seem upset.

05:01.280 --> 05:04.615
Being so weak must really be annoying.

05:07.747 --> 05:09.612
Oh? Is that not it?

05:10.166 --> 05:12.178
Well, either way,

05:12.449 --> 05:15.107
I'm getting bored with how sturdy you are.

05:16.689 --> 05:18.147
Let's end this!

05:21.803 --> 05:22.750
Too bad!

05:24.086 --> 05:25.095
Whoop!

05:25.470 --> 05:26.504
Getting closer!

05:26.652 --> 05:27.815
Real close.

05:28.049 --> 05:29.815
That was the closest yet!

05:30.535 --> 05:31.556
But…

05:33.876 --> 05:35.206
Too bad!

05:38.800 --> 05:41.255
Smilin's my aesthetic.

05:41.489 --> 05:44.418
I'm an entertainer, after all!

05:51.772 --> 05:52.603
Stand.

05:55.298 --> 05:58.338
It's the final round, dumbass!

06:07.827 --> 06:11.261
You all just keep scampering around.

06:11.692 --> 06:13.796
You damn small, speedy types…

06:14.615 --> 06:16.270
really piss me off.

06:25.729 --> 06:27.027
You little…

06:27.255 --> 06:28.486
piece of shit!

06:31.261 --> 06:33.101
Nice one, buddy.

06:33.489 --> 06:36.880
Looks like we both got a lotta fight left!

06:51.021 --> 06:53.015
What's wrong?

06:53.224 --> 06:57.003
I'm still rarin' to go!

06:57.095 --> 06:58.947
Huh?! Where'd that even c…?!

07:06.870 --> 07:08.756
W-Wait!

07:20.867 --> 07:24.116
You flew pretty good there! You make a great heel.

07:24.553 --> 07:29.569
Or you would. Can't say the way KEEL
does things puts a smile on my face.

07:33.193 --> 07:35.692
Who the hell would wait, dumbass?

07:37.667 --> 07:39.581
Ugh, not cool.

07:40.184 --> 07:42.916
What you gonna do about this, princess?

07:43.347 --> 07:46.633
Nothing. That was your own fault, brute.

07:47.913 --> 07:49.095
Guess so.

07:49.710 --> 07:53.636
Because unlike you, I'm strong!

07:55.070 --> 07:58.400
How are you not embarrassed, bitch?!

07:58.843 --> 08:03.723
If I was born as girly as you, I'd wanna die!

08:03.901 --> 08:07.083
Really? I like the way I am.

08:07.335 --> 08:09.692
Yeah, right!

08:11.040 --> 08:15.310
The weak have to obey the strong.

08:15.430 --> 08:21.236
That means the powerless don't even
have a reason to exist!

08:23.899 --> 08:25.685
- Oops, did I break your wrist?

08:25.693 --> 08:26.467
- You…
- Oops, did I break your wrist?

08:27.040 --> 08:28.566
aren't popular, are you?

08:28.960 --> 08:29.624
Huh?

08:29.772 --> 08:33.224
I bet women find you draining.

08:34.350 --> 08:37.649
It embarrasses me that we're the same species.

08:38.086 --> 08:41.329
Not popular? Of all the pointless…

08:41.329 --> 08:43.330
Oh? Did I hit a nerve?

08:43.846 --> 08:49.618
I was just thinking, if I was a girl,
I'd absolutely never want to be with you.

08:49.700 --> 08:52.153
So I was right? Sorry, man.

08:52.172 --> 08:53.027
Die!

08:54.000 --> 08:55.095
Oh, by the way…

08:55.538 --> 08:58.036
You obey the dude upstairs, yeah?

08:58.196 --> 09:00.695
Doesn't that mean you're weak?

09:01.821 --> 09:03.101
Don't make me laugh!

09:03.249 --> 09:05.390
I'm just lending him my strength!

09:05.513 --> 09:08.523
And I can only do that because I'm strong!

09:09.883 --> 09:14.566
Yeah, but that's only compared to
other members of your team, right?

09:14.763 --> 09:15.581
Huh?

09:15.926 --> 09:20.953
You're like a frog in a well. Actually,
wait, that's rude to the frog.

09:21.273 --> 09:24.196
You're just so very small.

09:24.363 --> 09:25.575
Oh, a split end.

09:26.400 --> 09:31.809
I'm the one who's embarrassed
we're the same species!

09:38.553 --> 09:39.895
What's with that limp…

09:40.695 --> 09:41.833
wristed…

09:42.209 --> 09:43.224
hit…

09:46.480 --> 09:48.123
Why…? So dizzy…

09:48.707 --> 09:53.747
Let's not be so arrogant about what we
just so happen to have been born with, hm?

09:54.375 --> 09:56.707
You'll be more popular that way.

09:57.821 --> 10:01.409
I don't like hitting people who can't move, but…

10:01.846 --> 10:05.335
It'll be a problem for everyone
else if you get up.

10:07.083 --> 10:08.135
Enomoto!

10:08.203 --> 10:11.292
Eyes on yourrr opponent! Focus!

10:20.012 --> 10:21.827
Th-Thank you!

10:23.212 --> 10:25.483
Our upperclassmen are amazing.

10:26.166 --> 10:27.944
There's only two of them,

10:29.144 --> 10:30.960
but they turned the tide!

10:33.913 --> 10:34.726
Takanashi!

10:39.027 --> 10:41.956
Hey. Nice save, Sakura.

10:43.643 --> 10:45.095
We're both beat up, huh?

10:47.993 --> 10:49.636
Huh? What's wrong?

10:49.883 --> 10:51.033
Sakurrra.

10:51.310 --> 10:52.713
You finished up?

10:52.935 --> 10:54.535
I took mine out, too.

10:54.590 --> 10:55.716
Same.

10:56.190 --> 10:59.396
Looks like Sugi's cleaned up shop, too.

11:00.092 --> 11:01.753
There are still some left.

11:02.836 --> 11:06.590
Don't relax until they're all down.
If you need help, call for me.

11:07.526 --> 11:10.578
I swear… I'll be there for you next time.

11:15.747 --> 11:16.596
Let's go!

11:22.463 --> 11:25.681
Wh-What the hell are you?!

11:35.513 --> 11:38.535
S-Seriously, what the hell?!
What's your damn deal?!

11:43.255 --> 11:45.316
What's with that look?!

11:45.852 --> 11:47.095
Goddammit!

11:47.643 --> 11:48.880
That eye…

11:49.329 --> 11:50.849
I'll smash i…

12:03.920 --> 12:05.729
What is it, Sakura?

12:06.307 --> 12:07.280
That's enough.

12:07.981 --> 12:09.341
He's out cold.

12:10.720 --> 12:14.400
There's a surprise. I didn't expect
you to be so cool-headed.

12:15.280 --> 12:18.332
Didn't getting beat like that get to your head?

12:18.935 --> 12:20.658
You bet your ass it did.

12:21.027 --> 12:22.627
I'm beyond pissed.

12:24.203 --> 12:25.218
At myself.

12:26.603 --> 12:28.966
I talked big, and now look at me.

12:29.864 --> 12:32.080
But getting pissed won't fix it.

12:33.156 --> 12:35.661
So I have to just do what I can.

12:36.984 --> 12:37.741
Okay?

12:41.796 --> 12:44.732
Aww, what am I to do with you, Sakura?

12:45.446 --> 12:49.556
But, well, it's as you say. There's no time
to deal with them one by one.

12:50.092 --> 12:51.409
I'll take this side.

12:52.904 --> 12:54.209
Let's end this quick.

13:00.695 --> 13:01.926
I really…

13:03.083 --> 13:04.898
can't beat you, can I?

13:45.489 --> 13:48.104
Ooh, that's a scary face.

13:48.443 --> 13:50.609
You really are like us!

13:51.080 --> 13:53.298
You look like you wanna fight so bad!

13:53.846 --> 13:58.110
I'm tellin' you, you'd have a lot more
fun with me, Natori Shingo.

13:59.452 --> 14:01.803
You're not hero material.

14:02.744 --> 14:04.812
No, you're an animal.

14:07.107 --> 14:08.344
You're right.

14:10.030 --> 14:12.910
I'm no hero.

14:19.476 --> 14:24.289
Back then, when I snapped, my mind went blank.

14:27.753 --> 14:28.756
When I came to,

14:29.649 --> 14:31.581
I'd be surrounded by bodies.

14:32.387 --> 14:36.603
Awesome! That must have been
one hell of a combat high!

14:38.049 --> 14:39.064
Every time…

14:39.630 --> 14:41.458
I felt awful.

14:42.436 --> 14:44.990
My wild side made me sick.

14:46.363 --> 14:49.403
But then I was taught to control it.

14:50.270 --> 14:52.553
He turned me into a half-decent human.

14:53.323 --> 14:57.033
You kidding? That wild side is the true you.

14:57.612 --> 14:59.753
Did you put this team together?

14:59.876 --> 15:00.553
Huh?

15:04.098 --> 15:08.209
You couldn't be more different
from the folks above me.

15:10.640 --> 15:11.858
Your point?

15:12.516 --> 15:15.692
You're not fit to lead.

15:16.836 --> 15:18.110
That's my point!

15:19.433 --> 15:20.836
Uuugh.

15:21.723 --> 15:23.009
"Not fit", huh?

15:24.036 --> 15:27.532
Don't talk like a human, you animal.

15:28.363 --> 15:33.593
Sorry to say, but it looks like you've
been tamed. You're their pet.

15:34.424 --> 15:39.353
So I'm gonna remind you how good
it feels to unleash the beast.

15:40.012 --> 15:46.153
I'll bind your true, natural self
with the chains of fear,

15:47.070 --> 15:49.187
and dominate you!

15:54.676 --> 15:57.600
Come on, come on! Is dodging all you're good for?!

16:19.803 --> 16:23.120
Damn, man. How weak can you be?

16:23.600 --> 16:27.366
Well, guess that's how it goes
when you're defanged.

16:29.144 --> 16:32.516
Seriously, the hell did they do to you?!

16:32.627 --> 16:38.098
Whoever made you human
didn't know a damn thing about you!

16:38.196 --> 16:40.664
Why make you so weak?!

16:41.132 --> 16:45.273
He's the one who's not fit!

17:00.018 --> 17:01.316
There it is!

17:02.873 --> 17:04.203
That's the face!

17:05.889 --> 17:07.600
I love that look!

17:20.221 --> 17:22.504
Yeah, I knew it!

17:23.310 --> 17:27.193
That face suits you way better!

17:29.796 --> 17:31.021
Getting to…

17:32.036 --> 17:33.489
dominate…

17:35.538 --> 17:36.707
this you…

17:37.267 --> 17:38.356
makes me…

17:38.873 --> 17:40.301
feel so…

17:48.270 --> 17:49.901
…alive!

18:06.067 --> 18:10.024
One more punch would have made ten…

18:14.283 --> 18:17.372
You passed out too fast.

18:18.652 --> 18:20.830
Looks like you finished up, too.

18:21.316 --> 18:22.787
Same with us.

18:32.455 --> 18:34.166
They'rrre waiting.

18:34.633 --> 18:35.550
For what?

18:55.575 --> 18:56.246
Hey.

18:56.769 --> 18:58.030
Let go already.

19:01.089 --> 19:01.944
Anzai.

19:02.658 --> 19:03.655
Anzai!

19:05.796 --> 19:07.569
Wake up, Anzai!

19:15.015 --> 19:16.055
What happened?!

19:16.295 --> 19:18.061
Fight's over.

19:18.843 --> 19:20.104
We won.

19:21.864 --> 19:22.769
I see…

19:23.372 --> 19:24.049
I…

19:25.513 --> 19:26.326
Sorry.

19:26.836 --> 19:27.729
Yo.

19:28.603 --> 19:29.655
You okay?

19:30.012 --> 19:31.963
Enomoto?! Why are you here?!

19:32.178 --> 19:35.889
Why? To rrrescue you guys!

19:36.516 --> 19:38.923
He's awake. You'rrre up.

19:40.049 --> 19:41.415
Actually talk to him.

19:41.913 --> 19:42.547
Na…

19:43.452 --> 19:44.492
Nagato!

19:47.390 --> 19:49.920
Why did you do all this?

19:51.187 --> 19:55.113
I said it didn't involve you.

19:55.784 --> 19:57.064
Not to butt in.

19:59.083 --> 20:01.440
But you did all this for m…

20:01.440 --> 20:02.886
Don't get it twisted.

20:03.673 --> 20:05.920
Who said we were doin' this for you?

20:06.836 --> 20:09.095
That shithead pissed me off,

20:09.550 --> 20:11.126
so I did it for me!

20:11.427 --> 20:12.904
Dude, Sakura…!

20:15.175 --> 20:20.473
That Tsuchiya girl was crying
because she couldn't help you.

20:21.458 --> 20:25.316
Anzai got beat up because he wanted to help you.

20:26.350 --> 20:29.889
And yet you can't even look him in the eye?

20:31.273 --> 20:33.200
If you didn't want to be saved,

20:33.907 --> 20:36.116
then at least tell them why not!

20:37.846 --> 20:39.132
They deserve to know.

20:39.581 --> 20:41.489
If nothing else…

20:42.270 --> 20:44.196
They're looking at you.

20:44.810 --> 20:46.516
I'm not turning away from you.

20:47.601 --> 20:49.102
[So how about]

20:49.102 --> 20:49.640
[So how about you turn]

20:49.640 --> 20:50.353
[So how about you turn]
Are you seriously okay with that?!

20:50.353 --> 20:51.354
Are you seriously okay with that?!

20:51.354 --> 20:52.609
[towards me?]
Are you seriously okay with that?!

20:59.649 --> 21:02.990
I… did awful things to you.

21:04.443 --> 21:07.440
Lots of things I can't take back.

21:08.923 --> 21:13.710
What's the point of saving someone like that?!

21:20.135 --> 21:23.230
You can think whatever you want about yourself,

21:23.741 --> 21:27.747
but Anzai still wanted to save you after all that.

21:28.320 --> 21:33.778
Your opinion is your own,
but he doesn't have to share it.

21:34.726 --> 21:36.338
For better or worse.

21:42.923 --> 21:43.846
How…

21:45.495 --> 21:48.449
How can you be so nice…?

21:50.510 --> 21:51.920
How can you be…

21:53.600 --> 21:55.476
so strong?

21:57.003 --> 22:00.048
[Resolution]

23:30.603 --> 23:36.135
That Natori guy Kaji fought looked
really happy while getting punched.

23:36.233 --> 23:37.187
So creepy.

23:37.286 --> 23:41.587
You're one to talk. You smile while you fight.

23:41.686 --> 23:46.006
So did you when you were fighting Togame.

23:46.590 --> 23:47.532
That was…

23:47.704 --> 23:49.840
Wait a sec, don't lump me in with you!

23:50.006 --> 23:53.101
How rude, talking about me like I'm some monster.

23:53.590 --> 23:54.836
I'm hurt.

23:54.940 --> 23:57.132
Ah, no… I went too far.

23:57.200 --> 23:58.246
Just kidding!

23:58.430 --> 23:59.569
You little…!
